# CONTRIBUTING Contribute-Guide SoT

**Role:** setup, gate + DX, contribute/PR workflow, docs map of **links**. **Not:** Design SoT, layout map, coverage/exit-code/adapter/fragile dumps.

Ownership: [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md). Lint: `lintContributingDoc`.

## Forbidden

- `\bM\d+\b`; directory trees → STRUCTURE; coverage tables → TESTING
- Local exit-code tables → cli-reference; Architecture/Fragile dumps → INTEGRATIONS / CONCERNS

## Allowed

- `HOTSPOT-*` naming when describing specs; gate `pnpm verify`; DX scripts; link-only documentation map

## Sync

Update when gate/DX/prerequisites/PR workflow change. Link SoTs — do not mirror them.
